[0.016064, "o", "spawn bash /Users/maximilien/github/maximilien/weave-cli/demos/repl-demo.sh\r\r\r\n"]
[0.010832, "o", "================================================\r\r\n  Weave CLI - AI-Powered REPL Demo\r\r\n================================================\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[0;34mð Page 1: AI-Powered REPL\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.000014, "o", "Weave CLI includes an AI-powered REPL (Read-Eval-Print Loop) that\r\r\nunderstands natural language commands using GPT-4o multi-agent system.\r\r\n\r\r\nPrerequisites:\r\r\n  • OPENAI_API_KEY set in environment\r\r\n  • weave-mcp binary installed (run: weave config update --weave-mcp)\r\r\n\r\r\nPress Enter to continue..."]
[3.003661, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[0.002221, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.000195, "o", "\u001b[0;34mð Page 2: Check Prerequisites\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n1. Check if weave-mcp is installed:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.000074, "o", "$ weave config show | grep WEAVE_MCP_STDIO_PATH\r\r\n"]
[0.009224, "o", "\u001b[1;33mweave-mcp not installed - run: weave config update --weave-mcp\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n2. Verify OpenAI API key is set:\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[0;32m✓ OPENAI_API_KEY is set\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.000006, "o", "Press Enter to continue..."]
[3.004819, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[0.002144, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.000172, "o", "\u001b[0;34mð Page 3: Simple Query Examples\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nTry these natural language queries:\r\r\n\r\r\n$ weave query \"show me all my collections\"\r\r\n$ weave q \"create a collection called TestDocs\"\r\r\n$ weave q \"add README.md to TestDocs\"\r\r\n"]
[0.000024, "o", "$ weave q \"search TestDocs for 'installation'\"\r\r\n$ weave q \"how many documents in TestDocs?\"\r\r\n$ weave q \"delete the TestDocs collection\"\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1;33mNote: Use 'weave query' or the short alias 'weave q'\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nPress Enter to see a live example..."]
[3.003915, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[0.002201, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.000197, "o", "\u001b[0;34mð Page 4: Example Query Output\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nWhen you run:\r\r\n\r\r\n$ weave q \"show me all my collections\"\r\r\n\r\r\nThe AI REPL will:\r\r\n  1. Understand your natural language query\r\r\n  2. Plan the best weave command to execute\r\r\n  3. Show you the plan and ask for approval\r\r\n  4. Execute: weave cols ls\r\r\n  5. Display results with real-time progress\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.000182, "o", "\u001b[1;33m(Skipping live execution in demo - requires interactive approval)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.00002, "o", "Press Enter to continue..."]
[3.000536, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[0.003125, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.000097, "o", "\u001b[0;34mð Page 5: Advanced Features\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nThe AI REPL supports:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.000048, "o", "  ð¤ Multi-Agent System\r\r\n     • 7 specialized agents for different tasks\r\r\n     • Planner, Executor, Validator agents\r\r\n\r\r\n  ð° Cost Tracking\r\r\n     • Track token usage and costs\r\r\n     • Color-coded cost display\r\r\n"]
[0.000108, "o", "\r\r\n  ð Smart Error Detection\r\r\n     • Detects errors in command output\r\r\n     • Provides helpful suggestions\r\r\n\r\r\n  ⏱️ Progress Tracking\r\r\n     • Real-time step progress\r\r\n     • Duration tracking for each step\r\r\n\r\r\n  ✨ Auto-Approval\r\r\n     • Simple weave commands auto-approved\r\r\n     • Confirmation for destructive operations\r\r\n\r\r\nPress Enter to continue..."]
[3.003957, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[0.002217, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.000243, "o", "\u001b[0;34mð Page 6: Dry-Run Mode\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nTest queries without making changes:\r\r\n\r\r\n$ weave q \"delete all my collections\" --dry-run\r\r\n\r\r\nDry-run mode:\r\r\n  • Shows what would be executed\r\r\n  • No actual changes made\r\r\n"]
[0.000101, "o", "  • Safe for testing complex queries\r\r\n\r\r\nPress Enter to continue..."]
[3.005091, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[0.002476, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.000084, "o", "\u001b[0;34mð Page 7: Interactive REPL Mode\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nStart interactive REPL session:\r\r\n\r\r\n$ weave\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.000066, "o", "Then type natural language commands:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.002475, "o", "weave> show me all collections\r\r\nweave> create TestDocs collection\r\r\nweave> add README.md to TestDocs\r\r\nweave> search TestDocs for \"installation\"\r\r\nweave> delete TestDocs\r\r\nweave> exit\r\r\n"]
[0.000123, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1;33m(Not running interactive mode in this demo)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nPress Enter to continue..."]
[3.003674, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[0.00234, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.000227, "o", "\u001b[0;34mð Page 8: Observability with Opik\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nWeave CLI integrates with Opik for LLM observability:\r\r\n\r\r\n  ð Metrics Tracking\r\r\n     • Token usage per agent\r\r\n     • Response times\r\r\n     • Success/failure rates\r\r\n\r\r\n  ð Trace Analysis\r\r\n     • Full conversation traces\r\r\n     • Agent decision flow\r\r\n     • Cost breakdown\r\r\n\r\r\n  ð Performance Monitoring\r\r\n     • Query performance over time\r\r\n     • Model comparison\r\r\n     • Cost optimization\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.000092, "o", "Press Enter to continue..."]
[3.005175, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[0.002291, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.000163, "o", "\u001b[0;32m✅ REPL Demo Complete!\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nSummary:\r\r\n  ✓ Learned about AI-powered REPL\r\r\n  ✓ Saw natural language examples\r\r\n  ✓ Discovered advanced features\r\r\n  ✓ Learned about dry-run mode\r\r\n  ✓ Explored observability features\r\r\n\r\r\nKey Features:\r\r\n"]
[0.000065, "o", "  ð¤ GPT-4o multi-agent system\r\r\n  ð¬ Natural language understanding\r\r\n  ð Safe with confirmations & dry-run\r\r\n  ð Full observability with Opik\r\r\n  ⚡ Real-time progress feedback\r\r\n\r\r\nNext steps:\r\r\n  • Install: weave config update --weave-mcp\r\r\n  • Try: weave q \"show me all collections\"\r\r\n  • Start REPL: weave\r\r\n  • See: docs/guides/WEAVE_CLI_AI.md\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.000748, "x", "0"]
